  "cleanText": "Solution home \n\t\tOnboarding\n\t\tOnboarding Guides: Getting Started with Capium\n\n### Onboarding Guide: Self Assessment (SA900)\n\n\t\t\tPrint\n\n\tModified on: Fri, 15 Sep, 2023 at  4:30 PM\n\n\t\tThis article will cover how you can create and submit the SA900 to HMRC\n\nVideo Tutorial:\n\nClick here to watch how to create and submit a SA900 tax return \n\nHelp Guide:\n\nCreating the SA900 return\n\nNavigate to the SA900 tab in the main dashboard and then select the trust. \n\nYou will be able to create a new SA900 by clicking on '+SA900'.\n\nYou can then create the tax return as required.\n\nEditing the Tax Return\n\nTo edit any of the information on the return, simply click on the link and enter the information. \n\nTo add a supplementary page, click on the '+ Add Supplementary Page' button and select the page you want to add.\n\nYou can then add the information in accordingly \n\nSubmitting the Tax Return \n\nTo submit the tax return to HMRC, go back into the client dashboard and using the action dropdown box, select 'Submit To HMRC'.\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDid you find it helpful?\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tYes\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tNo\n\nSend feedback\tSorry we couldn't be helpful. Help us improve this article with your feedback.",
