: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;  text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; display: inline !important; float: none;\"><img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9137079238/original/hCRVxHxzW-rauGjXXH5Mqe-6uH5pACocWA.png?1629110742\" style=\"width: auto;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"9137079238\"></span></strong></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><strong dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\"><br></strong></p><p dir=\"ltr\">You can then create the tax return as required.</p><p dir=\"ltr\"><strong dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\"><br></strong></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><strong dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\"><img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9137082919/original/e8_rl2Xo2TIE0sefvx226z2u-o09FrWPCA.png?1629113711\" style=\"width: auto;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"9137082919\"></strong></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><strong dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\"><br></strong></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><strong dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">Editing the Tax Return</strong></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\">To edit any of the information on the return, simply click on the link and enter the information.&nbsp;</p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9137083227/original/36hGn5KhmsCnu0P1z0EeRqbFwOVMNCpPjA.png?1629113930\" style=\"width: auto;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"9137083227\"></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\">To add a supplementary page, click on the '+ Add Supplementary Page' button and select the page you want to add.</p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9137083722/original/Bil4wIMTwZHZhXxgJf6McDtWIuOjc-gUFg.gif?1629114320\" style=\"width: auto;\" class=\"fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"9137083722\"></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\">You can then add the information in accordingly&nbsp;</p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9137083781/original/RCwL1NgWay61Wh4dfILd_5d3os0mJeqX1g.png?1629114384\" style=\"width: auto;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"9137083781\"></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><strong>Submitting the Tax Return</strong>&nbsp;</p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\">To submit the tax return to HMRC, go back into the client dashboard and using the action dropdown box, select 'Submit To HMRC'.</p><p><br></p><p><img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9137083901/original/01K6sWN6KF08Ku-TdevXM17OSg7QjqFxRA.png?1629114486\" style=\"width: auto;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"9137083901\"></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p>\n\t</article>\n\n\t<hr />\t\n\t\t\n\n\t\t<p class=\"article-vote\" id=\"voting-container\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-user-id=\"\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-article-id=\"9000205415\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-language=\"en\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDid you find it helpful?<span data-href=\"/support/solutions/articles/9000205415/thumbs_up\" class=\"vote-up a-link\" id=\"article_thumbs_up\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-remote=\"true\" data-method=\"put\" data-update=\"#voting-container\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-user-id=\"\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\td